    "  Use 'uip maestro case tasks describe --type connector-activity' to discover all inputs.",
    "  Hierarchy:  <input-name>.body.<field>",
    "    body                         request body input object",
    "    └── body                     the body property on the input",
    "        └── <field>              e.g. body (comment text), visibility.identifier",
    "    queryParameters              query string input object",
    "    └── body                     the body property on the input",
    "        └── <field>              e.g. issueIdOrKey, expand",
    "    pathParameters               URL path input object",
    "    └── body                     the body property on the input",
    "        └── <field>              e.g. id",
    "  Examples:",
    "    body.body.body               comment text for Add Comment",
    "    body.body.visibility.identifier  role restriction",
    "    queryParameters.body.issueIdOrKey Jira issue key (required)",
    "    pathParameters.body.id        resource path ID",
    "",
    "TRIGGER INPUTS  (wait-for-connector)",
    "  Single 'body' input with nested body.queryParams and body.filters.",
    "  Use 'uip maestro case tasks describe --type connector-trigger' to discover fields.",
    "  Hierarchy:  body.body.queryParams.<field> | body.body.filters.expression",
    "    body                         the only input object",
    "    └── body                     the body property on the input",
    "        ├── queryParams          event filter parameters (raw values)",
    "        │   └── <field>          e.g. project, issuetype (connector-specific)",
    "        └── filters",
    "            └── expression       JMESPath: equality clauses from queryParams && user filter",
    "  Examples:",
    "    body.body.queryParams.project     Jira project key (required)",
    "    body.body.queryParams.issuetype   issue type filter (required)",
    "    body.body.filters.expression      e.g. (project == 'PROJ') && ((fields.priority=`High`))"
